Power: enter whole watts, then Enter. h then Enter reads this help and returns to the field. Blank Enter cancels. YAC converts watts to an estimated relative percentage on Icom, using the model and band rating. On the IC-705, 3 watts is approximately 30 percent of its 10-watt scale; battery operation limits entry to 5 watts. This is an estimate, not measured output. Supply, mode, radio limits and regional models can affect actual power. Successful changes are silent. q leaves Settings; v reports the radio setting: percentage for Icom, watts for Yaesu/Kenwood.
